+name = "Quickshell.Services.Kde"
+description = "Plasma session services for a shell that replaces plasmashell"
+headers = [ "osd.hpp", "keyboard.hpp", "brightness.hpp", "secretagent.hpp", "bluetoothagent.hpp", "jobs.hpp" ]
+-----
+Pieces of plasmashell other parts of a Plasma session rely on:
+the on-screen display service (volume and brightness keys, keyboard
+layout switches), KWin's keyboard layouts, powerdevil's screen
+brightness, NetworkManager password prompts (instead of plasma-nm's
+secret agent), Bluetooth pairing prompts (instead of bluedevil's agent)
+and the progress of file operations (instead of the job view server of
+plasmashell).
